    <section class="section tint">
      <div class="shell">
        <div class="section-head center"><div class="section-kicker">The operating model</div><h2 class="section-title">VizAI carries the workload. Authority remains explicit.</h2></div>
        <div class="role-flow">
          <article class="role-card"><span>Customer</span><h3>Declares and confirms</h3><p>Provides baseline facts, confirms proposed changes, and supplies evidence only where the claim requires it.</p></article>
          <article class="role-card vizai"><span>VizAI delivery</span><h3>Does the majority of the work</h3><p>Researches, structures, drafts, checks, monitors, and prepares the report, task, or external action.</p></article>
          <article class="role-card"><span>VizAI owner</span><h3>Reviews and approves</h3><p>Checks quality, evidence, scope, and policy before a paid deliverable or public action can move forward.</p></article>
          <article class="role-card"><span>Governed system</span><h3>Publishes and records</h3><p>Releases approved work, versions the Canon, and keeps an auditable change and approval history.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

